    "description": "Overlooking True Blue Bay, this upscale beach resort, is 3.6 km from Maurice Bishop International Airport and 9 km from the National Cricket Stadium.\nFeaturing teak furnishings and bay-view terraces, the rustic, island-chic rooms provide kitchenettes, as well as free Wi-Fi and flat-screens. Upgraded rooms add 4-poster beds. Suites offer living rooms, dining areas and whirlpool tubs. The 2-bedroom villas include plunge pools.\nFreebies include breakfast and a beach shuttle. There's a restaurant/bar, an outdoor pool and a spa, as well as yoga. Other amenities consist of a playground, and activities such as cooking classes and scuba diving."
